  "description": "Three legendary arcade titles from SEIBU KAIHATSU's Raiden Fighters series return, revived from the depths of time.\n\nChoose between the Japanese version and a hardcore International version!\n\nEnjoy convenient features like rapid-fire button configuration, Practice Mode, and a restart function.\n\nGreat for both first-time players and those returning to 2D shooting games after a long break!\n\nThe remix soundtrack includes 30 tracks drawn from the stage and boss music from each title.\n\nEnjoy the music on the sound player, and assign music to each stage just as you like with a mode.\n\nCustomize the experience to your liking and discover a new world of Raiden Fighters!\n\nParticipating Artists: SOSHI HOSOI/KAZUHIRO TSURUKUBO/YUKI ARAI\n\nCheck out the wallpaper customization, an authentic arcade-style CRT filter, and Vertical Screen Mode (monitor rotation) that deliver a vivid sense of presence that goes beyond the arcade experience.\n\nPlay the reborn Raiden Fighters in its bold new form to your heart's content!\n\n■ Contents (Choose between the Japanese/International Version)\nRAIDEN FIGHTERS\nRAIDEN FIGHTERS 2\nRAIDEN FIGHTERS JET\n",
